    "detailed_description": "<h1>GAME OF MY FRIENDS</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>We are at war!<br><br><strong>Important point</strong><br><br>\u27a1 52 new levels!<br>\u27a1 Daily rewards!<br>\u27a1 4 exclusive cards!<br>\u27a1 Purchase and improvement of aircraft!<br>\u27a1 Aircraft control with joystick!<br>\u27a1 Addictive!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191510/extras/1d8f3f460e71afe82086b19953d2a42b.poster.avif?t=1694986961\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191510/extras/1d8f3f460e71afe82086b19953d2a42b.webm?t=1694986961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191510/extras/1d8f3f460e71afe82086b19953d2a42b.mp4?t=1694986961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There can't be any left! In PixHunter you must shoot down all enemy aircraft you encounter during your missions. But be careful! They will become stronger and more trained. Be precise and dodge enemy fire!<br>You will cover 52 new levels aboard fighter planes, you will be able to unlock more and more robust and powerful with victory rewards and daily mission bonuses!<br>Unlock the battle cards to add these war zones to your soldier's list!<br><br><strong>Your assets in the levels:</strong><br>- Protective shield<br>- Double / triple barrel<br>- Intensive care <br><br><strong>Will you be the first to end this war?</strong><br>Share your scores and battle photos in the Steam community of fighter pilots.<br><br><strong>Soldier, imminent departure on mission!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191510/extras/d2d8a7f629766e959f04fc7c9a8f714a.avif?t=1694986961\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute